30,2,1,talk,Rin,,The bin house at the station block smells really bad in summer! And the supervised mornings take almost an hour.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Midori,,"A shelter is quite expensive, even with the subsidy. Also, we're already spending money every year on nets and deodorants.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Most complaints come from the person living right next to the bins. Also, people aren't actually willing to police each other's bags.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"The truck comes very early, which makes a narrow window difficult. Those supervised mornings are a real time commitment.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Not all our frontages are the same size; some are too narrow. Also, the paperwork for a permanent build is very tedious.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, if it takes an hour, that's a long time to stand outside!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, if the paperwork is hard and the cost is high, maybe a permanent structure isn't the best?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, if we keep the current open system, the costs for nets and smells will just continue.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, exactly. And if the truck arrives before some people wake up, the ""window"" is a mess.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, but moving the point would require a new notice every single time. It's a bureaucratic nightmare.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want a smelly bin house! Let's not do that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Rin. If it's expensive and smells, it's not a win.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we can't agree on policing the bags, the supervised hours might just cause more fights.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,I don't want to spend an hour every few weeks standing in the cold or heat.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Asuka,,And we can't just rotate it if some frontages are too narrow to hold the bins.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
