55,3,1,talk,Rin,,I don't like the smell of the enclosure or the boredom of supervising. I'll vote for rotating!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Rotating seems the most budget-friendly, though Asuka mentioned the space issue.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Rotating might be the only way to stop the one neighbor from feeling targeted by the bins.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,"Rotating is better than standing there for an hour, even if it's a bit of a hassle to move.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"I'm concerned about the narrow frontages, but it's fairer than one person suffering forever.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Rin,,Yay! Let's make it fair for everyone!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, do you think we can make rotation work despite the narrow spots?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,We can just adjust the position slightly on the narrow ones.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,May,,"As long as I'm not the only one doing the work, I'm in.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Asuka,,It's the most logical choice if we want to avoid long-term resentment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for B!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'll vote for B too. It's the safest for our wallets.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,B it is. It preserves the peace.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,May,,I'm voting B. No supervised shifts for me.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I will also vote for B.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
